{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_title", "source_sha256": "3d17803e6809153b05b4a175a1aae15aa9a9702a285f7951c064acccb11cae21", "ja": "育とおでかけ1", "zh": "和育外出1", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "d3e433593bc1f687ca1d6a7408081d5f4855d3ccab95a0d3ba04fd5f08f53e3a", "ja": "育とおでかけした一幕です。", "zh": "和育一起外出时的一幕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "799b6aef5d7f085ab92049e9c38c48dcdd4a03aa1ffa9c52fa9267156e793796", "ja": "（神戸といえばオシャレな港町。育にもオシャレな\n仕事が舞い込んできたのだが、果たして……）", "zh": "（说到神户，就是时尚的港口城市。育也接到了时尚相关的工作，可是究竟能不能顺利完成呢……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1001_030iku", "source_sha256": "77271e62bdadba476cbe0fe7ec5533f78c74931d3b3d4e3020cbf61f663654bc", "ja": "{$P$}さん。今日のお仕事は、\nお洋服のショップをレポートすればいいんだよね？", "zh": "{$P$}先生。今天的工作，\n是要去探访服装店对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1002_p", "source_sha256": "abc0d1fbac818e24d086f0ca30dd4d3c369b688fdbef92a6e706f8d66fe3bba2", "ja": "ああ、そうだ。オシャレな子供服のブティックだから、\n育にぴったりだと思う。頼んだぞ！", "zh": "啊，没错。那是一家时髦的童装精品店，我觉得很适合育。就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1003_030iku", "source_sha256": "9d13df7d096cfbdec5f755a645e13bb0f580a7c97ca18dd7533c6ccda8560c27", "ja": "うん、まかせて！　かっこよく……あとは、\n気をつけることってあるのかな？", "zh": "嗯，交给我吧！要帅气地……除此之外，还有什么需要注意的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1004_p", "source_sha256": "8acc8a7769c37bf91ca52e8358a74bf7d9aabc9d3e4959a571de2f5a14d41561", "ja": "先方のリクエストは、上品で、\nお嬢様っぽい雰囲気だそうだ。できそうか？", "zh": "对方的要求是，要营造出优雅又像大小姐的氛围。你能做到吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1005_030iku", "source_sha256": "127f4dadb0b207a6e5534bf42f1488f1e5b5cb2f8fddf2d320ec07d395f32c0f", "ja": "できるよ！　おじょうさまって、千鶴さんみたいに\n「おーっほっほっほ！」って笑うんだよね？", "zh": "可以呀！大小姐就是像千鹤小姐那样，“哦——呵呵呵呵！”地笑，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1006_p", "source_sha256": "e420a872c70a1f404ca34305d9ad30f62e93f8797a7c2ba012c4bdc3c10faddc", "ja": "それは……そういう人もいるけど、\nそうじゃないお嬢様もいるかな？", "zh": "那个……确实也有人是那样，不过，也有不是那样的大小姐吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1007_030iku", "source_sha256": "bb0cf838281c6094f2b4deeb54837a1d44d6a681e10a1bba4b7d8b4c91563be1", "ja": "そっか、おじょうさまにもいろいろあるんだね。\nわたし、がんばってみる！　いってきまーす♪", "zh": "这样啊，大小姐也各有各的样子呢。\n我会努力试试的！我出发啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0251_story_030iku01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0251_story_030iku01_1008_p", "source_sha256": "91b23b142e076a58d06c33d4fb875a754102ef514ba441a896b383c5599607f2", "ja": "（育のお嬢様観が少々心配になるが……ともあれ、\n仕事は上手くやってくれそうだ。頑張れ、育！）", "zh": "（育对大小姐的理解让人有点担心，不过……总之，她应该能顺利完成工作。加油，育！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
